# WSX calendar development

Full guide: `.cursor/skills/wsx-work/SKILL.md`

## Rules

- Use `@autoRegister`, `WebComponent`, `@state` — no Vue/React inside `.wsx`
- Styles: `import styles from "./X.css?inline"`
- Events: `CustomEvent` with `bubbles: true`
- Tests: `await element.updateComplete` before assertions (WSX render is async)

## Structure

- `Calendar.wsx` — root `<wsx-calendar>`
- `views/DayView.wsx`, `WeekView.wsx`, `MonthView.wsx` — view components
- `utils/event-utils.ts` — pure helpers

## API reference

RFC-0008: `observedAttributes` = `view`, `date`, `events`, `user` with getter/setter.
